        "text": "noncomputable def cartesianMonomial (h b : ℝ) (f : Inner → ℝ) (z : SpaceTime) : ℝ := SimilarityProfile.pullback h b f (AxisymmetricFields.profilePoint z.1 z.2), where pullback h b f p = q h p ^ b * f (inner h p) (SimilarityProfile.lean:45) — the object q^b g(x_⊥/√q, η) in axisymmetric variables"
